   "widgets_values": [
    "# One long shot with MiniMax H3 (up to 40 s)\n\n**Free workflow by Stable Yogi.** One start picture, one prompt, one unbroken take with voice and sound.\n\n1. Put your start picture in **Load start picture** (the example: `sy-pool-start.png`).\n2. Write what happens and what is said in **Prompt**. Keep `[ENGLISH] She says: \"...\"` for speech.\n3. Set **Length** (frames, 24 per second). See the table on the right.\n4. Queue. You get a small take first (`H3-longshot/take`), then the 1080p copy (`H3-longshot/hd`).\n\nSize: **736 x 416**. In our tests this size kept the face steadiest over a long take.\nBigger sizes look sharper per frame but drift more. The upscale does the sharp part.\n\n**Models** (ComfyUI downloads them from the loader nodes, or get them from\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3):\n- `minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` -> models/diffusion_models\n- `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` -> models/text_encoders\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` -> models/vae\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` -> models/vae\n"
   ],
