   "widgets_values": [
    "# Length helper\n\n| Seconds | Length (frames) |\n|---|---|\n| 5 | 124 |\n| 10 | 243 |\n| 20 | 481 |\n| 30 | 719 |\n| 40 | 957 |\n\nH3 only takes lengths on its own grid (17 x n + 5). Other numbers snap up.\n\n**Will my lines fit?** She speaks about 2.5 words a second.\nWords needed = seconds x 2.5, so 40 s needs about 100 words.\n\n**Fill the whole length with speech.** H3 fills a quiet end with made-up\nwords. Too many words and the take cuts the last line.\n\n**Tip:** test with 124 frames (5 s) first. Same seed, same start picture, then go long.\n"
   ],
   "title": "Length helper",
