   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Upscale to 1080p (SeedVR2)\n\nNeeds the custom node pack **ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler** by numz\n(ComfyUI Manager, or https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler).\nThe model files download by themselves on first use.\n\nWe use the **7B sharp** model: it keeps the same face. A second H3 pass at a\nbigger size draws a new face, so we do not use that.\n\nLess VRAM? Pick a `3b` model or a `Q4_K_M` gguf in **Upscale model**, and raise\n`blocks_to_swap`. Less system RAM? Set `resolution` to 720.\n\nNo upscale wanted: select the four blue nodes and press **Ctrl+B** (bypass)\nor delete them. The small take is already saved.\n"
   ],
